[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]汉末割据与曹魏平定[/font][/b]


东汉末年，凉州军阀长期盘踞。[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马腾", "cat": "people"}]马腾[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "韩遂", "cat": "people"}]韩遂[/url][/color]以羌胡为兵，据陇右、关中，与中原群雄对峙。


[indent]•  建安十六年（211）：曹操采先取关中、再克凉州战略。据《三国志·[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马超", "cat": "people"}]马超[/url][/color]传》："曹公用[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "贾诩", "cat": "people"}]贾诩[/url][/color]谋，离间超、遂"，马超、韩遂败走陇右，关中平定。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  212-214年：马超围凉州刺史[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "韦康", "cat": "people"}]韦康[/url][/color]于冀县，占领后自称"征西将军，领[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "并州", "cat": "geography"}]并州[/url][/color]牧，督凉州军事"。[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "杨阜", "cat": "people"}]杨阜[/url][/color]、姜叙起事，马超投奔[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张鲁", "cat": "people"}]张鲁[/url][/color]，后归蜀汉。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  214年：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "夏侯渊", "cat": "people"}]夏侯渊[/url][/color]逐马超、破韩遂、灭枹罕宋建，"虎步关右"，陇右凉州基本平定。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  220年曹丕重置凉州：首任刺史邹岐上任，张掖张进举兵相拒，金城黄华、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "麹演", "cat": "people"}]麹演[/url][/color]相应。护羌校尉[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "苏则", "cat": "people"}]苏则[/url][/color]讨平，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张既", "cat": "people"}]张既[/url][/color]继任。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  221年：卢水胡叛乱，凉州刺史张既采声东击西策（虚张旗鼓于东，奇兵渡河西出）平之。[/indent]
