[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]蜀汉"凉州战略"（虚衔政治）[/font][/b]


蜀汉将凉州视为北伐的最终战略目标。蜀汉先后设置三任凉州刺史，均为虚衔：


[indent]1.  [color=#000000]马超[/color]：以凉州本地豪强、有羌胡威望，战略意义重于实际统治[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  [color=#000000][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "魏延", "cat": "people"}]魏延[/url][/color][/color]：建兴八年（230）奉命西入羌中，在阳溪破魏将费瑶、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "郭淮", "cat": "people"}]郭淮[/url][/color][/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  [color=#000000][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "姜维", "cat": "people"}]姜维[/url][/color][/color]：延熙六年（243）"迁镇西大将军，领凉州刺史"，多次出陇西与郭淮、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "邓艾", "cat": "people"}]邓艾[/url][/color]争夺陇右[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


诸葛亮第一次北伐（228）的战略意图即在于：出[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "祁山", "cat": "geography"}]祁山[/url][/color]→攻陇右（天水、南安、安定）→进而图谋凉州，以"蚕食雍凉"积累战略优势。因[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马谡", "cat": "people"}]马谡[/url][/color][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "街亭", "cat": "geography"}]街亭[/url][/color]败绩而功败垂成。


